## Why This Is Asked
Tests bridging basics, event emitters, and lifecycle safety in a practical beginner task.

## Key Concepts
- React Native bridge modules (iOS/Android)
- Event emission vs method calls
- Lifecycle cleanup to avoid memory leaks
- Debouncing rapid clipboard changes

## Code Example
```javascript
// JS wrapper
import { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } from 'react-native';
const { ClipboardModule } = NativeModules;
const ce = new NativeEventEmitter(ClipboardModule);

export const copyText = (text) => ClipboardModule.copyText(text);
export const getClipboard = () => ClipboardModule.getClipboard();
export const onClipboardChange = (cb) => ce.addListener('clipboardChanged', cb);
export const stopListening = () => ce.removeAllListeners('clipboardChanged');
```

